{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7c833fad-a9b1-8102-ac11-c72a8fd0aa06",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:32:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about a pothole. The cold patch they put in last week washed out. It's gone again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Where is the pothole located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "374 Dean Avenue. Right in front of the house, by the curb side of the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "374 Dean Avenue. Got it. And you said a patch was done last week, and now it's washed out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "As I said, yes. [sighs] The patch is out and the hole's back. Pieces of it are all over the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Can you tell me about how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about two feet across. Maybe a little more. Deep enough that you feel it in the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, so a good size. I'm writing that down. Is it on the Fifth Ward end of Dean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the one. Look, how long do repairs usually take? I'd just like to know what to expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few days to a week or so once it's logged. Cold patch in winter doesn't always hold, so sometimes a crew has to come back. I'll note that it's a repeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. That's what I figured."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one seven one. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colin Dolan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Dolan. So that's a pothole at 374 Dean Avenue, about two feet across, the earlier cold patch washed out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Okay, I've got to run. I have a book club tonight and I haven't finished the book."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, well, good luck with the rest of it. We'll get this in to the crew today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
